                        "translation_id": "755ea769-83b0-4b77-a749-4ea4511d1c81",
                        "source_entry_id": "ffa1e7bf-5c6e-345b-ad7b-50a891e5defb",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fae4c97-b1f4-3008-95e6-57c5684735a5",
                        "target_lang_word": "normalization",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "normalization",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ba90b2e-197b-3056-966c-2ac4b3c3e5de",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any process that makes something more normal or regular, which typically means conforming to some regularity or rule, or returning from some state of abnormality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "396ee022-48ec-48fd-9520-526f7d4ff063",
                                                "sense_id": "2ba90b2e-197b-3056-966c-2ac4b3c3e5de",
                                                "text": "In the writings of Banfield, Wilson, and the New Progressives, the present-oriented, the wicked and the disorderly are portrayed as being abnormal―as being in need of normalization, control, and supervision. This makes it a lot easier for the rest of us […] to accept the aggressive policing and harsh punishment of the disorderly others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b66da9ad-42df-3a58-b3d0-4166eec4e422",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Standardization, act of imposing standards or norms or rules or regulations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4669bb80-ec60-3847-a125-609d919fcdd5",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In relational database design, a process that breaks down data into record groups for efficient processing, by eliminating redundancy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa296692-2c1a-46ee-bc20-1a045797e12c",
                                                "sense_id": "4669bb80-ec60-3847-a125-609d919fcdd5",
                                                "text": "Meronym: atomization"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52c0454c-3141-3844-a7fe-e6c12e49cbb3",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Process of establishing normal diplomatic relations between two countries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c79142e1-d4e9-46d1-8798-36fde855614f",
                                                "sense_id": "52c0454c-3141-3844-a7fe-e6c12e49cbb3",
                                                "text": "Following the line pursued in recent months by President Mubarak, Mr. Ali said he was confident the peace treaty between the two former foes would presist^([sic]) and \"create a good atmosphere for normalizations of relations in the coming months and years.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f31bd0-6ea0-4824-b362-12a0981e8ac6",
                                                "sense_id": "52c0454c-3141-3844-a7fe-e6c12e49cbb3",
                                                "text": "On my first trip to China after normalization, I saw firsthand the possibility of leveraging Deng Xiaoping’s very real fear of the Soviets to gain specific intelligence aid from the People’s Republic of China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ed4ceac-9b42-33da-b60f-21e674e83e5d",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Globalization, the process of making a worldwide normal and dominant model of production and consumption."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "281648b1-6c63-34de-859d-20248bd0ac7b",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Normalized production."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37e5e4af-397a-3bee-8dd2-c3800c50bcea",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sharing or enforcement of standard policies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5367ac1-1640-3582-ba54-837ad824f978",
                                        "entry_id": "d45937fa-8abc-32a0-8deb-4d727781bb7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process whereby artificial and unwanted norms of behaviour and models of behaviour are made to seem natural and wanted, through propaganda, influence, imitation and conformity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
